markdown <<MARKDOWN
You are helping a sustainability office learn from its neighborhood's air quality data.

**☑️ Do This:**
- Open [this spreadsheet](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PwiAoyUxXgNit2Xe7xy0Gov2W__JvSk8/view?usp=sharing) containing data for the sustainability office.
- Look at a few different rows of data in the dataset, exploring each row’s values.
- In **Step 2** of your Project Planning Guide, write down at least three questions that could be answered by the dataset. Choose questions for which the answers might be useful to the sustainability office!

MARKDOWN
